Helpers under PrivateKey/EncryptThenTag/: Tools (simulation through a state
abstraction in law, coins in advance, functions overridden by a table),
Machines (budget cap, parameter halving, width transport), Games (the CCA2
experiment with a pad and a tag function), Handler (the T2 handler of the
tag-key PRF reduction), Reduction (the reduction at parameter 2n and step 1),
Transfer (the CCA2 experiment as the experiment with f and g).
EncryptThenTag.lean: ccaScheme readers and step 1; ccaScheme_cca2 still sorry.
